{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18750","headline":"捣衣曲 · 刘禹锡","name":"捣衣曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爽砧应秋律，繁杵含凄风。\n一一远相续，家家音不同。\n户庭凝露清，伴侣明月中。\n长裾委襞积，轻佩垂𤧚珑\n汗余衫更馥，钿移麝半空。\n报寒惊边鴈，促思闻候虫。\n天狼正芒角，虎落定相攻。\n盈箧寄何处，征人如转蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}